title: A minimap of the selected long file shows at the right of the canvas, and the setting that turns it off is found by searching Settings for minimap
folders: git-changes
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3500
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1500
mark a-minimap-with-changes
wait 450
diff on
wait 1200
mark b-minimap-with-diff
wait 450
diff off
left settings:minimap
wait 1200
mark c-the-setting
wait 450
left settings:close
wait 600
quit
